usize</span>, a2: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>, a3: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>, a4: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>, a5: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code></pre>\n<h4>参数</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>request: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/valgrind/callgrind/#std.valgrind.callgrind.ClientRequest\">ClientRequest</a></code></pre>\n<pre><code>a1: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span></code></pre>\n<pre><code>a2: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span></code></pre>\n<pre><code>a3: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span></code></pre>\n<pre><code>a4: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span></code></pre>\n<pre><code>a5: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.valgrind.callgrind.dumpStats\"><h3><code>std.valgrind.callgrind.dumpStats</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L22\">第 22 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>转储各成本中心的当前状态，然后将其清零</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">dumpStats</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code></pre>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.valgrind.callgrind.dumpStatsAt\"><h3><code>std.valgrind.callgrind.dumpStatsAt</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L30\">第 30 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>转储当前成本中心状态，然后将其清零。\n参数会附加到说明转储触发原因的字符串之后。此字符串会作为\n描述字段写入性能分析数据转储。</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">dumpStatsAt</span>(pos_str: [*:<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>]<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code></pre>\n<h4>参数</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>pos_str: [*:<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>]<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.valgrind.callgrind.startInstrumentation\"><h3><code>std.valgrind.callgrind.startInstrumentation</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L51\">第 51 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>如果尚未启用，则启动完整 callgrind 插桩。\n进行缓存模拟时，会清空模拟缓存；\n这会导致之后出现人为的缓存预热阶段，\n产生现实中不会发生的缓存未命中。</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">startInstrumentation</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code></pre>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.valgrind.callgrind.std\"><h3><code>std.valgrind.callgrind.std</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">别名</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L1\">第 1 行</a></p>\n<p>别名目标 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std\"><code>std</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.valgrind.callgrind.stopInstrumentation\"><h3><code>std.valgrind.callgrind.stopInstrumentation</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L62\">第 62 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>若尚未关闭，则停止全部 Callgrind 插桩。\n这会刷新 Valgrind 的翻译缓存，之后不再执行额外\n插桩，实际运行速度与 \"none\" 工具\n相同，即开销最小。\n可用于让无关代码绕过 Callgrind 的统计汇总。\n若希望启动 Callgrind 时即采用此模式，以忽略准备阶段，\n使用选项 \"--instr-atstart=no\"。</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">stopInstrumentation</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code></pre>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.valgrind.callgrind.toggleCollect\"><h3><code>std.valgrind.callgrind.toggleCollect</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L43\">第 43 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>切换收集状态。\n收集状态指定是否记录\n事件的发生，或忽略事件。通过递增\n成本中心的计数器记录事件。</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">toggleCollect</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code></pre>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.valgrind.callgrind.valgrind\"><h3><code>std.valgrind.callgrind.valgrind</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">别名</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L2\">第 2 行</a></p>\n<p>别名目标 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/valgrind/#std.valgrind\"><code>std.valgrind</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.valgrind.callgrind.zeroStats\"><h3><code>std.valgrind.callgrind.zeroStats</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L35\">第 35 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>零代价中心</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">zeroStats</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code></pre>\n</section>\n<details class=\"source-code\" id=\"source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><summary>源码</summary><p><code>std/valgrind/callgrind.zig</code></p><div class=\"source-grid\"><pre class=\"line-numbers\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-copy-ignore=\"\"><code><a id=\"L1\" href=\"#L1\" tabindex=\"-1\">1</a>\n<a id=\"L2\" href=\"#L2\" tabindex=\"-1\">2</a>\n<a id=\"L3\" href=\"#L3\" tabindex=\"-1\">3</a>\n<a id=\"L4\" href=\"#L4\" tabindex=\"-1\">4</a>\n<a id=\"L5\" href=\"#L5\" tabindex=\"-1\">5</a>\n<a id=\"L6\" href=\"#L6\" tabindex=\"-1\">6</a>\n<a id=\"L7\" href=\"#L7\" tabindex=\"-1\">7</a>\n<a id=\"L8\" href=\"#L8\" tabindex=\"-1\">8</a>\n<a id=\"L9\" href=\"#L9\" tabindex=\"-1\">9</a>\n<a id=\"L10\" href=\"#L10\" tabindex=\"-1\">10</a>\n<a id=\"L11\" href=\"#L11\" tabindex=\"-1\">11</a>\n<a id=\"L12\" href=\"#L12\" 